<title>SWITZERLAND: Elektrowatt unit in Inepar venture.</title>
<headline>Elektrowatt unit in Inepar venture.</headline>
<dateline>ZUG, Switzerland 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Landis &amp; Gyr Utilities, part of the Elektrowatt group, said it had formed a joint venture with Brazil's Inepar group to make electricity meters for the South American market.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Landis &amp; Gyr Utilities will hold 51 percent of  Landis &amp; Gyr Inepar SA, which will use Inepar's production facilities and Landis &amp; Gyr's knowhow.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
